flowchart TD
  Review["Review source and destination"] --> Lock["Owner lock and revision check"]
  Lock --> Source["Read all source before deleting"]
  Source --> Valid{"All rules and recipes valid?"}
  Valid -->|No| Rollback["Rollback everything"]
  Valid -->|Yes| Copy["Replace seven destinations in one transaction"]
  Copy -->|Failure| Rollback
  Copy -->|Success| Commit["Increment once; readback; commit"]
  Commit --> Core["Core sync adopts receipt"]
